    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">You are a solo barista at a coffee shop, and suddenly <var>N</var> customers walk in at the exact same time. Each customer orders a drink that takes a specific amount of time <var>T</var> to prepare.<br><br>A customer's &quot;wait time&quot; is the sum of the preparation times of everyone served before them, plus the time it takes to make their own drink.<br><br>To prevent a riot, you decide to make the drinks in an order that minimizes the total combined wait time of all customers. Find that minimum total wait time.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1</strong>: An integer <var>N</var> representing the number of customers.<br><strong>Line 2</strong>: <var>N</var> space-separated integers representing the preparation time <var>T</var> for each customer's drink.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1</strong>: A single integer representing the minimum total combined wait time.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &lt;= <var>N</var> &lt;= 1000<br>1 &lt;= <var>T</var> &lt;= 100</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">3\n5 2 3</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">17</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
